          "title": "Chronological timeline",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "2a.1",
              "text": "Aldan House collapse was first reported at 06:58 UTC, followed by government confirmation of destruction at 07:08 UTC; warnings for Cobbett Row were issued at 07:16 UTC; PUSAR deployment began at 08:47 UTC and was confirmed by multiple sources by 09:04 UTC; Nerridge fire service rescued 9 people at 09:50 UTC.",
